  "interpretation": {
    "item5": "Splitting by damage type improves R2 from 0.8206 to 0.8339. Torpedo/dot have HIGHER coefficient than direct, contradicting the DOT-overvaluation hypothesis. Class dummies still matter (R2 drops to 0.8117 without them), but CV/SS class penalties shrink. DD penalty actually increases slightly.",
